{"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","game_versions":["1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","1.21.10","1.21.11"],"id":"HEeDeKB8","slug":"cccyrillic","project_type":"resourcepack","team":"kZvvHOvg","organization":null,"title":"CCCyrillic","description":"CC:Tweaked cyrillic languages support layer","body":"## CC:Tweaked Cyrillic Font (Win1251)\n\nThis resource pack replaces the default CC:Tweaked font with a **Windows-1251 compatible Cyrillic font**.\n\nThis project can help you actualy **TYPE (INPUT)** cyrillic characters, rather than just output them to the console.\n\n## ⌨️ How to enable typing\nThe resource pack only changes how text _looks_. To be able to _type_ in Cyrillic, you need to install a driver script.\n\nRun this command on your ingame computer(or turtle):\n```\npastebin get SE2bgZCy /startup/cyrillic.lua\n```\n\nAfter downloading, **reboot the computer**.\n\n## ⚙️ Configuration\nThe script runs in the background automatically. To change the keyboard layout, `edit` the first line of `/startup/cyrillic.lua`:\n- `LOCALE = 'RU'` (Russian - Default)\n- `LOCALE = 'UA'` (Ukrainian)\n- `LOCALE = 'BY'` (Belarusian)","body_url":null,"published":"2026-02-09T08:36:34.472023Z","updated":"2026-02-09T09:10:27.811558Z","approved":"2026-02-12T07:33:45.635405Z","queued":"2026-02-09T09:35:10.421120Z","status":"approved","requested_status":"approved","moderator_message":null,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License","url":null},"downloads":372,"followers":3,"categories":["fonts","locale","modded"],"additional_categories":["gui"],"loaders":["minecraft"],"versions":["iynHVE5y"],"icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/HEeDeKB8/5771b90091eb110464f8d9cfa229db953c19223f.png","issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"gallery":[{"url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/HEeDeKB8/images/57677f4ba11a8e9988e948